#: ../../webgis-src/che1_tools/sec01_owslib/section.rst:9
msgid ""
"OWSLib is a Python package for client-side programming with the Open "
"Geospatial Consortium (OGC) Web Services (OWS) interface standard and its"
" associated content model."
msgstr ""

#: ../../webgis-src/che1_tools/sec01_owslib/section.rst:13
msgid ""
"OWSLib was originally included in PCL, but was proposed as a separate "
"project in R481."
msgstr ""

#: ../../webgis-src/che1_tools/sec01_owslib/section.rst:16
msgid ""
"OGC Web services toollibrary, Python package uses OGC maps, functions, "
"and overlay services. OWSLib provides general API access GetCapabilities,"
" service metadata and wrapper access maps, and GETFEATURE requests."
msgstr ""

